abstract: >-
  A generic, extensible genetic programming framework for Julia from
  the maintainer of neat-python. First-class support for NEAT neural
  topology evolution, LLM-as-operator (FunSearch / AlphaEvolve
  pattern), symbolic regression, multi-objective optimization
  (NSGA-II), quality-diversity search (Novelty Search, MAP-Elites),
  CMA-ES, and closed-loop control-task benchmarks. Follows the
  Problem/Algorithm/Solve pattern from the SciML ecosystem via a
  CommonSolve.jl integration.
